ize: large;\">郭采昕<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/hooe.html\" target=\"_blank\">Hōo你ê真珠～記念『米拉』老師</a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">14</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Chô Nâ-sim<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/ha-chhiu.html\" target=\"_blank\">Hă-chhiùⁿ</a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">43</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蔡宗邑<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/blog-post_39.html\" target=\"_blank\">獨行</a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">45</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿瑞--ā話仙</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">藍春瑞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/ekua.html\" target=\"_blank\">阿義ê罪kuà</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>5</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語sa攏有講座</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／薛翰駿</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／陳亮穎<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2023/11/iah-watchoute.html\" target=\"_blank\">倡議團體iah是網路媒體？</a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2023/11/iah-watchoute.html\" target=\"_blank\">——「沃草」（Watchout）ê故事</a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">6</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心內話</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">吳睿穎<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/e_3.html\" target=\"_blank\">我ê少年台文老師</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>8</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">翁月鳳<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/e_78.html\" target=\"_blank\">感謝我ê狀元老師</a><br />10</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/e_77.html\" target=\"_blank\">蔡月賓走揣台語ê鬥圖</a><br />12</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">高嘉徽<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/a-bu-e-peh-thau-tsang.html\" target=\"_blank\">A-bú ê Pe̍h-thâu-tsang</a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/a-bu-e-peh-thau-tsang.html\" target=\"_blank\">阿母ê白頭鬃</a><br />13</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Khu Ì-têng<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/blog-post_16.html\" target=\"_blank\">做伙學習真歡喜</a><br />14</span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣人寫真</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蔡秋芬<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/e_95.html\" target=\"_blank\">新ê舊日誌——記念『米拉』（一）</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>15</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">簡義倫<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/blog-post_49.html\" target=\"_blank\">阮阿媽</a><br />19</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">夏玉華<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/blog-post_36.html\" target=\"_blank\">思念</a><br />21</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張淑真<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/ho.html\" target=\"_blank\">寄日拆仔去hō͘--你</a><br />44</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">讀冊開講</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張翠華<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/khiang-beh.html\" target=\"_blank\">〈Khiàng姆--仔beh起行〉朗讀心得</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>23</span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐家來phò-tāu</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張寶明<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/e_16.html\" target=\"_blank\">我是麵路--ê</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>25</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">韓&nbsp; &nbsp; 滿<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/e_54.html\" target=\"_blank\">上愛ê滋味</a><br />27</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán來講看māi</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳育萱<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/e_11.html\" target=\"_blank\">講古仙ê成仙撇步</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>29</span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">光景bóng uē</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">謝秀吟<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/leh-leh.html\" target=\"_blank\">鹽水，伊leh等你來行行--leh</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>32</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">彭桓恩（Phîⁿ Hoân-un）<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/e_17.html\" target=\"_blank\">油羅溪ê記持</a><br />42</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sann-kap讀小說</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">李志明<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/hoo-lan-bong-kha-mai-kong-pat-kua.html\" target=\"_blank\">Hóo-lān Bóng Khà, Mài Kóng Pat-kuà</a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/hoo-lan-bong-kha-mai-kong-pat-kua.html\" target=\"_blank\">虎lān bóng khà，mài講八卦</a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">35</span></span></div><div s